                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="sec-tag">Chairman & Founder</div>
                <h2 class="sec-title">Col. (R) <span>Imran Shah</span></h2>
                <div class="title-line"></div>
                <p class="sec-desc mb-3">
                    Col. (R) Imran Shah is the founder and chairman of Star Security Services.
                    With over 30 years of distinguished service in the Pakistan Army, he brought
                    military discipline, strategic thinking, and an unwavering commitment to
                    excellence into the private security sector.
                </p>
                <p class="sec-desc mb-4">
                    Under his visionary leadership, Star Security has grown from a small
                    investigation firm into Pakistan's leading Total Security Solutions Provider —
                    serving over 250 corporate clients across 24 cities with a workforce of
                    2800+ trained personnel.
                </p>
                <div class="row g-3">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="chairman-stat">
                            <i class="fas fa-medal"></i>
                            <div>
                                <div class="cs-num">30+</div>
                                <div class="cs-lbl">Years of Experience</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="chairman-stat">
                            <i class="fas fa-trophy"></i>
                            <div>
                                <div class="cs-num">24+</div>
                                <div class="cs-lbl">Years Leading Star Security</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

